{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:29 2026-10-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:29 2026-10-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:29 2026-10-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"新皇崗口岸自啟用後，成為不少市民來往兩地的選擇。 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd88cef8b6ff88dec28272fde4ea88ea/2026-10/image009.jpg\"/><p>新皇崗口岸在本周一已正式開通運行，口岸在「一地兩檢」的基礎下，採用嶄新的「合作查驗、一次放行」通關模式，設有134條「合作查驗」自助通道及68個傳統人工櫃枱。已登記的旅客使用「合作查驗」自助通道時，只需排隊一次及出示一次證件，便可完成港深兩地出入境手續。</p><p>入境處今日就在社交平台發布圖文懶人包，詳細拆解不同身分人士的登記方法、適用證件以及過關手續，方便市民及旅客隨時查閱。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f213e48387f2376b4debff8ba97930c/2026-10/ig_gate_tc_01.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5848ba244de12cff0b9eebb98de96d8b/2026-10/ig_gate_tc_02.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/211e10d1a2c5d284b19ce9c00e1f4f3d/2026-10/ig_gate_tc_03.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3504fd7dda6fe84bb3c47ac61e183212/2026-10/ig_gate_tc_04.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b98583e4be19688aa5629d0a546aec1a/2026-10/ig_gate_tc_05.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/965fc58e6db36bd9751c74615f8f69fc/2026-10/ig_gate_tc_06.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/09dcfe766b2e7ddf187e1f16e4d7169d/2026-10/ig_gate_tc_07.png\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T13:39:40.465523+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:29:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T19:58:34.770944+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T13:37:38.436584+00:00","content_hash":"7000c5a2a8c1b3cc16947bf353c2a449754eb9464e754f94ad58c89572c30bbf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}